Twenty is a full-featured CRM platform. Here's what you can build with it.

<CardGroup cols={2}>
  <Card href="/user-guide/data-model/overview" img="/images/user-guide/halftone/data-model.png">
    <CardTitle>Custom Data Model</CardTitle>
